# `specs.get`

Full spec record + body.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.specs.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`SpecGetResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `spec` | `map` |
